<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — VisaPath.pk" description="How Tech Traders, operator of VisaPath.pk, handles website data, optional analytics, external services and privacy choices.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Updated 14 November 2026.</p>
    <h2>Who operates this site</h2>
    <p>VisaPath.pk is operated by Tech Traders, a registered business in Pakistan. Contact <a href="mailto:info@visapath.pk">info@visapath.pk</a> with privacy questions or requests. Do not email passports, bank statements or other sensitive application documents.</p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we receive your address and message. We use these to respond to questions, investigate corrections and maintain necessary correspondence. VisaPath does not offer visa applications or require an account to use its tools.</p>
    <h2>Calculator inputs</h2>
    <p>Calculations run in your browser. Our calculator code does not send the amounts, travel dates or selected visa types you enter to our server. When an exchange-rate tool loads, your browser requests reference rates from open.er-api.com; that provider receives connection information such as your IP address. Calculator results are estimates and should not contain sensitive personal information.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and operational information</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted on Vercel. Hosting and security services may process connection and request information, including IP addresses, requested pages, browser information and timestamps, to deliver and protect the site. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel’s privacy policy</a>. External rate requests are subject to <a href="https://www.exchangerate-api.com/privacy">ExchangeRate-API’s privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>Google Analytics loads only after you choose “Accept analytics”. It can use cookies and online identifiers to measure visits and interactions, including page URLs, browser/device information and approximate location. This is not a promise that all usage data is anonymous. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites using its services</a>.</p>
    <p>Use “Privacy choices” in the footer to accept or reject Analytics. Rejecting it leaves the tools available. We store this preference in your browser for up to 180 days before asking again. Rejecting after previously accepting disables future Analytics collection through our integration and attempts to remove its first-party cookies; it does not undo information already sent to Google.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Advertising partners, including Google if AdSense is enabled, may place or read cookies or use identifiers and IP addresses to serve and measure advertising, subject to the applicable consent choices. We will configure the relevant advertising consent message before enabling ads. The Analytics choices on this site are not a Google-certified advertising consent platform.</p>
    <p>You can manage Google personalised advertising through <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/">My Ad Center</a> and read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">Google’s advertising technologies explanation</a>. These controls are separate from your consent choice on this website.</p>
    <h2>Retention, transfers and your choices</h2>
    <p>Email is retained only as needed to handle the enquiry and legitimate record-keeping obligations. Hosting, analytics and rate-service retention depends on the provider and configured service. We do not claim a specific Analytics retention period that has not been confirmed in the account. Providers may process information outside Pakistan.</p>
    <p>Contact us to request access, correction or deletion of personal information we hold, or to raise a privacy concern. We may need to verify a request and explain any applicable limits. You can also clear browser storage or use your browser’s cookie settings; blocking optional analytics does not prevent use of our calculators.</p>
    <h2>External websites and changes</h2>
    <p>Official government, application and other external links have their own privacy practices. We update this notice when our use of services changes and show the revision date above.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
